      539.53,
      539.73,
      561.52
    ],
    "text": "The Motor Traffic (Motor Tricycle) Regulations, No. 04 of 2017 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No.2035/ 51 of September 8, 2017 are hereby amended as follows :-",
